：药师寺 禅\n腹黑细致的医者，对事物有很大的好奇心，在生活起居上照顾梵，会关注梵的心情状态但是绝不溺爱，张弛有度的训狗师。\n\n蓝色：梵\n缺乏人类常识的狗子，之前一直关在实验室里被苛待，跟着药师寺踏上旅途之后担任护卫的工作，对药师寺有占有欲，也很喜欢他对自己的照顾。办事急躁并擅长使用暴力，经常因此被教训。\n\n关系：梵需要摄入药师寺的血液作为食物，在他摄取血液后的一段时间，药师寺可以通过接触和下令的方式让梵完全听命于自己。\n是饲主和狗的关系，没有相互剖白心情，处于拉扯阶段。\n\n更多例图详见：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10dVqPGe5iMwTNo-9PRiGrZfsLTxYh4OL?usp=sharing\n\n请您随意描绘旅途中休息或者是赶路等等的场景！\n请给个机会！感谢您！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1204Ryuu/works/18", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bf1ac07c/uploads/origins/1e81f775-eb74-4574-a0a8-c4772919dd98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=426c01bc413f9b83e494a239bbc1d29a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bf1ac07c/uploads/origins/1e81f775-eb74-4574-a0a8-c4772919dd98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=426c01bc413f9b83e494a239bbc1d29a, https://si.imgix.net/bf1ac07c/uploads/origins/1e81f775-eb74-4574-a0a8-c4772919dd98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1d02f8ad7400e1c1589985fa65d6985 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bf1ac07c/uploads/origins/1e81f775-eb74-4574-a0a8-c4772919dd98?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74c2cb7d75d19088f9fc623ad2ec9f02 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "梅梅好！我端着我家所有oc走过来了.jpg\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/14_IwmyFVFcIVw9Ytpg8OoWMgE4xqGZH7?usp=drive_link\nhttps://ringed-boar-aba.notion.site/1d2cb4fdc03d807b8ac1f553f8aff4de?pvs=4\n两个链接里的oc是不一样的（准确来说有一个重叠x）\n\n提前感谢梅梅！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@1204Ryuu/works/17", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/59f8a6f3/uploads/origins/61f36cc6-0b3e-40b5-98a3-5496f68310eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e23c32b980e061cdafd626cb8b730e48", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/59f8a6f3/uploads/origins/61f36cc6-0b3e-40b5-98a3-5496f68310eb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e23